e price toward the $3,050 support. Any more losses might send the price toward the $3,000 region in the near term. The next key support sits at $2,880 and $2,850. Technical Indicators Hourly MACD – The MACD for ETH/USD is gaining momentum in the bearish zone. Hourly RSI – The RSI for ETH/USD is now below the 50 zone. Major Support Level – $3,150 Major Resistance Level – $3,350",
