        "URL": "https://timestabloid.com/xrp-price-will-skyrocket-if-this-happens/",
        "BODY": "Ongoing discussions within the cryptocurrency community continue to center on the XRP price if it becomes widely adopted in global financial systems. Despite a sharp rally over the past year, some analysts argue that XRP remains undervalued compared to its expanding use in cross-border settlements and digital asset liquidity. One such commentator, known as Pumpius, recently outlined a detailed analysis exploring several possible valuation paths for XRP, depending on adoption milestones. His argument rests on the idea that XRP should not be viewed purely as a speculative asset, but as a functional component of international liquidity systems. He maintains that the token’s long-term price trajectory will be determined by transactional demand rather than investor sentiment. Ripple’s Banking License and Regulatory Expansion Pumpius’ first scenario centers on Ripple’s pursuit of a national trust bank charter in the United States, a process initiated in mid-2025. The proposed entity, based in New York, would serve as a limited-purpose trust bank specializing in custody and blockchain infrastructure services. HAVE YOU EVER WONDERED? What’s the true price potential of XRP if adoption goes all the way? From banks to central banks, from corporations to capital markets and beyond into genomic identity. Here’s the ladder pic.twitter.com/TDWECRNRtB — Pumpius (@pumpius) September 6, 2025 If the Office of the Comptroller of the Currency (OCC) approves, Ripple could expand into regulated financial services, including stablecoin management, digital asset custody, and the tokenization of traditional instruments such as treasuries and bonds. According to the analysis, such approval could allow Ripple to handle settlement flows exceeding $500 billion annually, positioning XRP as a key liquidity vehicle within its ecosystem. Under these conditions, Pumpius projects that XRP could reach approximately $50 per token. The Corporate Treasury Integration Scenario A second projection focuses on large-scale corporate adoption. Pumpius suggests that if multinational corporations, such as Apple, Tesla, or Amazon, migrate portions of their treasury operations and supplier payments to the XRP Ledger, it could represent up to $5 trillion in annual transaction volume. While major corporations have not yet made such transitions, smaller firms have begun integrating XRP-related services into their operations. For instance, in 2025, VivoPower allocated $19 million of its capital raise to XRP staking through the Flare Network, and Trident Digital committed $500 million toward an XRP reserve. We are on X, follow us to connect with us :- @TimesTabloid1 — TimesTabloid (@TimesTabloid1) June 15, 2025 Other firms, including Nature’s Miracle and Hyperscale Data, have followed suit, with total institutional commitments surpassing $1 billion by mid-year. Pumpius argues that if large-scale corporations adopt similar strategies, the token could potentially rise to $100, given its efficiency as a cross-currency settlement asset. Global Market Tokenization and Long-Term Outlook The final projection addresses XRP’s possible role in tokenizing traditional financial markets. Pumpius estimates that if assets such as stocks, bonds, and exchange-traded funds, worth over $100 trillion, were to migrate onto blockchain platforms like the XRP Ledger, liquidity demand would surge significantly. He asserts that such integration could drive XRP’s value above $100,000 per token, assuming it becomes the primary asset facilitating settlement across global capital markets. However, these figures are highly speculative. The analysis assumes extensive institutional and regulatory adoption that has yet to materialize. While the projections offer insight into the potential scale of blockchain-based finance, they remain theoretical. For now, XRP continues to operate as a bridge asset with expanding but still limited real-world usage, and any future valuation will depend on verifiable market adoption rather than projections. Disclaimer : This content is meant to inform and should not be considered financial advice. The views expressed in this article may include the author’s personal opinions and do not represent Times Tabloid’s opinion. Readers are urged to do in-depth research before making any investment decisions. Any action taken by the reader is strictly at their own risk. Times Tabloid is not responsible for any financial losses. Follow us on Twitter , Facebook , Telegram , and Google News The post XRP Price Will Skyrocket If This Happens appeared first on Times Tabloid .",
